@startuml
title Integration Architecture — Legacy SOAP

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Modern Service" as Modern
participant "Integration Adapter" as Adapter
participant "SOAP Service" as SOAP
database "Legacy System" as Legacy

Modern -> Adapter : Domain request

Adapter -> Adapter : Map domain → SOAP contract

Adapter -> SOAP : SOAP / XML request
SOAP -> Legacy : Legacy operation

Legacy --> SOAP : Result
SOAP --> Adapter : SOAP / XML response

Adapter -> Adapter : Map SOAP → domain response

Adapter --> Modern : Domain response

@enduml
